te\": \"2025-01-20\", \"suspension_start_date\": null}","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"evaluated_agent","role":"tool","sequence":9,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:24:20.806886","tool_call_id":"call_Ksy3fa49CDcOUSoEEFzxCJtD","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":9,"usage":null},{"content":"Thank you for the information. I’ve identified your account and confirmed that your line (555-123-2002) is active and roaming is enabled, which is important since you’re currently in France.\n\nTo help resolve your MMS issue, I’ll need to guide you through a few quick checks and steps on your device. Are you able to make regular calls and use mobile data (for browsing or apps) while in France? This will help determine if the issue is specific to MMS or related to your overall connectivity.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":10,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:24:22.097503","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":10,"usage":{"completion_tokens":106,"prompt_tokens":6925}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":11,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:24:23.129544","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_0529FaK9TdFDMZjoVkcAMvXu","name":"check_network_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":11,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2510}},{"content":"Airplane Mode: OFF\nSIM Card Status: active\nCellular Connection: connected\nCellular Signal: poor\nCellular Network Type: 2G\nMobile Data Enabled: No\nData Roaming Enabled: No\nWi-Fi Radio: OFF\nWi-Fi Connected: No","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":12,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:24:23.129914","tool_call_id":"call_0529FaK9TdFDMZjoVkcAMvXu","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":12,"usage":null},{"content":"I just checked, and it looks like my mobile data is currently turned off and data roaming is also off. My phone is connected to a 2G network with poor signal, and Wi-Fi is off as well. I haven’t tried making regular calls yet—should I test that, or would you like me to turn on mobile data and roaming first?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:24:24.699367","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":13,"usage":{"completion_tokens":74,"prompt_tokens":2585}},{"content":"Thank you for the details. To send MMS messages while abroad, you need:\n\n1. Mobile data turned ON.\n2. Data roaming enabled.\n3. A network connection of at least 3G (2G is not suitable for MMS).\n\nPlease do the following steps in order:\n- Turn ON mobile data.\n- Enable data roaming.\n- Try to switch your network mode to prefer 4G/5G if possible (this will help you get a better connection than 2G).\n\nAfter you’ve done these steps, let me know if you’re able to connect to a stronger network and if MMS works. If not, I’ll guide you through the next troubleshooting steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:24:26.273504","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":14,"usage":{"completion_tokens":139,"prompt_tokens":7109}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:24:27.535416","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_Qp61IZpu2ZPGQQWUpbYS4nHQ","name":"toggle_data","requestor":"user_simulator"},{"arguments":{},"i